  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health System Strengthening Project in Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the achievement of the objectives of the National Health Development Plan (2015-2024) by improving the supply of care at the different levels of the health pyramid. 



The specific objectives are: (i) Strengthen the quality of integrated and harmonized maternal, neonatal, child, infant and child health care provision; (ii) Make available the specialized human resources and specialty health products required for the optimal functioning of Donka National Hospital; (iii)

Improve emergency management in healthcare establishments; (iv) Create a modern center for integrated Cancer treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
